<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - S.AFRICA DETAILS JULY GOLD/FOREX RESERVES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - S.AFRICA DETAILS JULY GOLD/FOREX RESERVES.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Reserve Bank detailed July combined gold and foreign exchange reserves as follows:</p>
<p>			    Jul '97	     Jun '97     Jul '96</p>
<p>Assets: (Rand millions unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>  Gold		    5518.56	     5181.26     6531.27</p>
<p>  Foreign		17295.41	    16949.86     3839.01</p>
<p>  Total		  22813.98	    22131.12    10370.28</p>
<p>  Gold shr of total     24.19  pct	  23.41	 62.98</p>
<p>  Gold volume	  4.08  million oz	3.77	  4.21</p>
<p>  Gold value	    1353.64  rand/oz  1373.02     1550.59</p>
<p>  Other liabilities   8612.03	     7090.23     5508.77</p>
<p>  Total liabilities  37459.93	    36170.19    31549.21</p>
<p>NOTE - The central bank announced the headline figure for May on June 2.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
</text>
